<title>GERMANY: Krones says 96 pretax profit doubles.</title>
<headline>Krones says 96 pretax profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>German beverage and bottling machinery maker Krones AG said on Tuesday its net profit doubled as expected to 26.6 million marks ($15.4 million) as sales rose three percent to 1.63 billion marks.</p>
<p>Krones in November said it expected a doubling of net profit in 1996, from 13.2 million marks in 1995. It also forecasted rising Asia and Latin American sales would boost group revenue to about 1.6 billion marks from 1.58 billion marks in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 260 97 150 ($ = 1.730 German Marks)</p>
